1，	Simulation experiments and real-data experiments are conducted, However, in order to verify the effectiveness of KOPI, more experiments on other real-data datasets are needed;

2，	It will be better if the authors can provide an analysis of the false nondiscovery proportion (FNP), a dual quantity of FNP, or its expectation FNR., see [1] .

[1] Genovese C, Wasserman L. Operating characteristics and extensions of the false discovery rate procedure[J]. Journal of the Royal Statistical Society Series B: Statistical Methodology, 2002, 64(3): 499-517.

